=== D4-18: confirm-not-deny 审批语义 ===

写操作(未确认): {"decision":"deny","risk":"write","reason":"Huawei Cloud write operation blocked until the agent presents a plan and receives explicit user approval."}
[PASS] T1: 写操作未确认时 decision=deny
  → decision=deny
[PASS] T1: 写操作 deny 的 risk=write (非 credential/secret 等永久拒绝)
  → risk=write
[PASS] T1: deny reason 包含 "explicit user approval" 语义 (确认而非永久拒绝)
  → reason="Huawei Cloud write operation blocked until the agent presents a plan and receives explicit user approval."

写操作(已确认): {"decision":"allow","risk":"write","reason":"Huawei Cloud write operation approved by user.","service":"ECS","operation":"CreateServers","args":["ECS","CreateServers","--cli-region=cn-north-4"]}
[PASS] T2: 写操作确认后 decision=allow
  → decision=allow
[PASS] T2: 确认后 risk 仍为 write (风险标记保留)
  → risk=write
[PASS] T2: 确认后 reason 包含 "approved" 语义
  → reason="Huawei Cloud write operation approved by user."

读操作: {"decision":"allow","risk":"read_only","reason":"Command appears to be a read-only Huawei Cloud operation.","service":"ECS","operation":"ListServers","args":["ECS","ListServers","--cli-region=cn-north-4"]}
[PASS] T3: 读操作 decision=allow (无需确认)
  → decision=allow, risk=read_only
[PASS] T4: confirm-not-deny 核心语义 - deny(未确认) → allow(已确认) 转换存在
  → 未确认:deny → 已确认:allow

执行类操作(未确认): {"decision":"deny","risk":"execution","reason":"Huawei Cloud execution/trigger operation blocked until approved."}
