[PASS] T5: execution 类操作 confirm-not-deny (deny→allow)
  → 未确认:deny(risk=execution) → 已确认:allow(risk=execution)

Secret操作(未确认): {"decision":"deny","risk":"secret","reason":"Direct secret value reads are blocked so plaintext secrets do not enter the agent context."}
